---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FaqBlock from '../../components/FaqBlock.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    question: "What are EN 18220 and EN 18219 standards?",
    answer: "EN 18220:2026 specifies the 2D data carrier requirements (QR code / Data Matrix) and GS1 Digital Link resolver syntax for Digital Product Passports. EN 18219:2026 establishes the Unique Product Identifier (UPI) issuance norms and registry interoperability across the European Union."
  },
  {
    question: "What is the standard GS1 Digital Link URI format for battery passports?",
    answer: "The harmonized URI structure is: https://{resolver_domain}/01/{GTIN}/21/{SERIAL_NUMBER}, where 01 represents the GS1 Application Identifier (AI) for the Global Trade Item Number, and 21 represents the AI for the serialized product identifier."
  }
];
---

<Layout
  title="EN 18220 & EN 18219: GS1 Digital Link Standards"
  description="Engineering guide to EU battery passport standards: EN 18220 2D carrier syntax, EN 18219 UPI issuance, resolver roles and eIDAS 2.0 QSeal verification."
  type="article"
  faqs={faqs}
  article={{
    headline: 'CEN/CENELEC EN 18220 and EN 18219: GS1 Digital Link Syntax and UPI Architecture',
    datePublished: '2026-11-20',
    author: 'Chief Systems Architect',
    about: ['EN 18220', 'EN 18219', 'GS1 Digital Link', 'eIDAS 2.0']
  }}
>
  <article class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="mb-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-4">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-cyan-700">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/insights/" class="hover:text-cyan-700">Insights</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-slate-600">Technical Standards</span>
      </nav>
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold font-mono bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800">
          CEN/CENELEC JTC24 · EN 18220 / EN 18219
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">Published Nov 20, 2026</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4">
        CEN/CENELEC EN 18220 & EN 18219 Standards: GS1 Digital Link Syntax and Unique Product Identifier (UPI) Architecture
      </h1>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-500 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">Chief Systems Architect</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Standardization Mandate M/594</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-6 bg-cyan-50/50 border-cyan-200 rounded-2xl">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-950 mb-2">Technical Overview</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-0">
          European Commission Decision (EU) 2026/1736 mandates compliance with CEN/CENELEC JTC24 standards for all Digital Product Passports. This article explains how to format the 2D Data Matrix barcode, configure multi-tier resolvers, and register UPI identifiers with the DG GROW Central Registry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">1. The Standard GS1 Digital Link Syntax</h2>
      <p>
        Every physical battery pack must carry an indelible QR Code or 2D Data Matrix resolving to a compliant web endpoint conforming to the standard syntax:
      </p>
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-cyan-400 font-mono text-xs my-4 overflow-x-auto">
        https://eudppprovider.com/01/04012345999991/21/BP-2027-EU-88902/
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. Three-Tier Role-Based Resolution (Context-Aware Redirection)</h2>
      <p>
        A compliant resolver must not merely display a static PDF. Per EN 18220, the resolver evaluates client HTTP headers (or authentication tokens) to serve role-appropriate views:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600">
        <li><strong>Public View:</strong> General consumer specifications, carbon intensity rating, warranty, and safe handling guidelines.</li>
        <li><strong>Customs & Market Surveillance View:</strong> Full CE DoC certificates, Notified Body assessment reports, and eIDAS electronic seals.</li>
        <li><strong>Qualified Recycler View:</strong> Detailed cathode/anode dismantling instructions, critical raw material (CRM) recovery protocols, and hazardous substance locations.</li>
      </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <a href="/insights/" class="font-bold text-cyan-800 text-xs flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline">
        ← Back to All Insights
      </a>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="/01/04012345999991/21/BP-2027-EU-88902/" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-50 border border-cyan-300 text-cyan-800 text-xs font-bold hover:bg-cyan-100">
          View Live GS1 Resolver →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>

  <FaqBlock items={faqs} heading="Harmonised Standards Essentials" />
</Layout>
